<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Great Lakes Chemical Corp to neutral from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 1/4 to 48-3/4.</p>
